module console

// Printing to standard output and standard error. Any values may be passed;
// they are separated by single spaces.

// The console library.  Bodies are linked from stdlib/console.c; these
// declarations give the compiler the call signatures.  Variadic: any
// number of values of any type may follow.

// Prints the values separated by spaces, then a newline. Bools print as true
// or false and null prints as 0. With no arguments it prints just a newline.
void console_print(...)
// Like console_print, but writes no newline at the end.
void console_write(...)
// Like console_print, but writes to standard error.
void console_error(...)
